  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-583f11a3030214f1b42025ad",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "本例阐明了合理选择极点以及采用对称根轨迹（SRL）技术的价值。最初选用极点时欠妥的极点配置导致了更大的控制作用量，并产生了一个不稳定的校正器。采用 SRL（或 LQR）技术，或通过改进极点配置，可以消除这两个不良特性。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "This example illustrates the value of judicious pole selection and of the SRL technique. The poor pole selection inherent in the initial use of the poles results in higher control effort and produces an unstable compensator. Both of these undesirable features are eliminated using the SRL (or LQR), or by improved pole selection.",
